  "releaseNotes": "10.0.0: first public release. The shared user model of the iot-vn Authentication Service: the user constants, IUser, UserDto (one Role with exact Permissions as joined paths such as \"*\" or \"user.*\"; Roles and AssignedFeatures deprecated), UserRoleDto, Coordinate, CentralCoordinate, the user, password reset request, role and permission entities, and the storage interfaces a Users database library implements (IUserDatabaseService, IPasswordResetRequestDatabaseService, IUsersDatabaseInitializationService, IRoleDatabaseService, IPermissionDatabaseService). The internal versions 1.0.0 to 2.0.0 were never published (see the README version history). Versioning: the major version is the highest .NET version targeted; minor versions can be breaking, so pin an exact version.",
